  "observations": [
    "Both reproduced failures deliver Enter, commit a combine through route.fetch with HTTP200 and abort the browser response as intended.",
    "The application immediately starts the authoritative recovery GET. The GET remains pending without headers or failure until timeout; UI remains busy.",
    "This rules out missing keyboard activation, lost selection or no recovery request for these reproductions.",
    "Installed Playwright _onRoute removes a times-limited handler before handle completes, then asynchronously changes interception patterns once the last handler returns. The Chromium implementation toggles Fetch.disable and cache state."
  ],
