  "playwright_core_source_sha256": "549070af3acabb3efcc4f55bfe6210f9f7c2fcf633cf7eaa59bfe60719969171",
  "proposed_bounded_fix": "Keep the interception handler registered until test-context teardown. Fail exactly one matching combine using an explicit boolean; continue subsequent requests. Keep response waiters registered before activation and explicitly verify backend commit. Scrolling/readiness assertions may strengthen keyboard intent but do not explain this traced failure.",
